# Agent prompts & skills (PGBot)

Follow user skill **`agent-prompt-library`** (`~/.cursor/skills/agent-prompt-library/`).

## Prompting

- Outcome + verify in one message (tests, build, smoke, browser, `/health`)
- Reference files with `@path`; paste logs/screenshots for bugs
- Module work: BASELINE sha, SCOPE, FORBIDDEN, DONE WHEN, HARD STOP next module
- Reports: `docs/factual-integrity/` with cannot-verify list when evidence missing

## Verify commands

| Layer | Command |
|-------|---------|
| Backend (no PG) | `cd backend && pytest -q -m "not postgres"` |
| Backend + PG | `pytest -q -m postgres` (needs local Postgres) |
| Frontend | `cd frontend && npm run test && npm run build` |
| Public smoke | `bash scripts/smoke-public.sh https://pushkinskie-gory.xyz` |
| Prod health | `/health` → `git_commit` must match deployed HEAD |

## Skill routing

| Task | Skill |
|------|-------|
| Minimal hotfix | `ponytail` |
| Map/browser prod check | `playwright` / browser MCP |
| Find code | `codebase-exploration` |
| PR + CI loop | `babysit` |
| Security / bugbot review | `review-security` / `review-bugbot` |

## Deploy / git

- Push, deploy, prod changes: **only when user explicitly asks**
- Staged modules: factual-integrity doc per module; do not start N+1 without instruction
- CI: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` + `deploy.yml` on `main`
